      "writtenOn": "2024-08-05T23:22:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, if while in the `AudioOn` or `Connected` states, we get notified of a `STATE_DISCONNECTED` as a stack event, we then transition to `Disconnecting`.\n\nHowever, we\u0027re _not_ going to get another `STATE_DISCONNECTED` stack event. Your logic below depends on that event to transition from `Disconnecting` -\u003e `Disconnected`. This means every incoming disconnecting we get will result in a timeout.\n\nYou need some way to handle this I think.",
