      "writtenOn": "2024-08-05T23:22:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`BluetoothHeadsetClient.STATE_AUDIO_CONNECTED` is not a connection state. Its an audio state.\n\nYou want to broadcast the same connection state change regardless of the previous state begin `Connected` or `AudioOn`, `CONNECTED` -\u003e `DISCONNECTING`. `AudioOn` implies `CONNECTED` because its a child state of `CONNECTED`.",
