      "side": 1,
      "message": "FWIW, I think these state machine objects are meant to be reused. There\u0027s not a single call that I can find to individually remove a state machine object from `HeadsetClientService`\u0027s `mStateMachineMap`! So you definitely do want to defer messages like connect. We may want to defer more too.\n\nOr, we need to clean up that pattern and not reuse state machines.\n\nA comment might be nice with that detail. That detail would also be good in the object level docstring.",
