      "writtenOn": "2024-08-05T23:22:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the case that we placed an outgoing disconnect call, we need this state change event to indicate we\u0027re disconnected before we\u0027ll transition to `Disconnected`.\n\nHowever, why are we not looking at the value of the connection state we\u0027re receiving from the native stack? We could get a `STATE_CONNECTED` here and we would still transition to `Disconnected`, which seems wrong.",
